# Local-only material, NOT for the public repo. The entire captures/ directory
# is private: ground-truth scans, device dumps, Canon's proprietary onboard
# app/binaries (reverse-engineering source material), and our own private index
# (captures/README.md). To the public repo, captures/ does not exist.
# The one reverse-engineered artifact the product needs is committed separately
# as src/r10/data/cot_sequence.json (our own derived command data).
/captures/

